# This tree holds authored sources, notes and harnesses only:
# design docs, patches, build/run scripts, and the Rust code we wrote for
# each experimentation lane. Vendored upstream trees (Mesa, musl, PipeWire,
# COSMIC components, cargo-extracted crates, etc.) and build products
# (binaries, sysroots, toolchains, staged images) are deliberately excluded
# from this import and must be rebuilt from the recorded recipes (the
# build-*.sh / *.md notes alongside them), not committed here.
#
# leandros is a Rust-only repo: C/C++ sources are out of scope here by
# design and continue to live only in the untracked artifacts source tree
# (~/code/leandros-artifacts) — don't reintroduce them via a future drop-in.
*.c
*.h
*.cc
*.cpp
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.so.*
*.rlib

# Build output / vendored / regenerable directories
build/
builddir/
out/
target/
deps-*/
sysroot/
sysroot-*/
stage-*/
toolchain/
logs/
__pycache__/
node_modules/
vendor/
rootfs/

# Binary / image / archive / disk-image formats
*.img
*.iso
*.fd
*.tar
*.tar.*
*.tgz
*.zip
*.ppm
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bin
*.log
*.crate

# ...but EVIDENCE IS NOT BUILD OUTPUT, and the rules above swept it up.
#
# Every "photographed" claim this project makes rests on a capture, and every
# capture was silently excluded by *.png / *.log above: `git add` skips ignored
# paths without erroring, so a lane can commit its results.md and believe the
# frames went with it. The aarch64 vkrender captures were lost exactly that way
# and had to be re-copied off the box by hand. A result whose evidence lives on
# one machine's /tmp is a result nobody can re-check.
#
# So: captures and run logs under notes/ are part of the authored record and
# are kept. Elsewhere in this tree they are still build output and still go.
!notes/**/*.png
!notes/**/*.log
#
# *.ppm stays excluded deliberately: it is the raw capture format and a single
# 1920x1080 frame is ~6 MB, against ~1 MB for the same frame as PNG. Convert to
# PNG and commit that; keep the PPM on the machine that took it.

# Editor / OS temp files
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
*~
*.tmp
*.bak
